# AMICOR Delivery production freeze

AMICOR Delivery operational surfaces are frozen after the 2026-09-08 cleanup pass.
Do not add Delivery features or make opportunistic refactors.

## Protected

- Delivery-facing ops-shell branding and navigation (`ops-shell.html`, `ops-shell.js`)
- Driver apply / onboarding resume and Driver 001 safety
- Shared Health ISF backend used by Delivery (do not rename modules or migrate hostname)
- Frozen private-pay revenue path (see `private-pay-revenue-freeze.mdc`)

## Allowed

- Verified launch-blocking bugs
- Compliance-required changes
- Launch-critical business needs explicitly requested by the user
- Read-only audits and documentation

## Hard prohibitions unless the user explicitly overrides

- Stripe LIVE / real-money keys
- Delete, reset, replace, or duplicate Driver 001
- Render hostname / service rename away from `amicor-health-isf`
- Broad refactors, maps work, website redesign, new Delivery features
- AMICOR Nova feature work in this freeze window
